onNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"337617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"46531","synopsis":"Saruwatari craves a strong opponent and someone proposes going after the best assassin in Fukuoka, the Niwaka Samurai. Immediately after, the phone rings Banba’s agency, but because he is at the Yamagasa Festival, Lin pretends to be the Niwaka Samurai and goes to kill Saruwatari. Forced to use weapons he isn’t used to fighting with, Lin quickly gets into trouble. Meanwhile, Banba has just gotten wind that Lin took a job while claiming to be the Niwaka Samurai.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2CBuDil56yWv7Prv3OCfYjVG2U9.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Saruwatari craves a strong opponent and someone proposes going after the best assassin in Fukuoka, the Niwaka Samurai. Immediately after, the phone rings Banba’s agency, but because he is at the Yamagasa Festival, Lin pretends to be the Niwaka Samurai and goes to kill Saruwatari. Forced to use weapons he isn’t used to fighting with, Lin quickly gets into trouble. Meanwhile, Banba has just gotten wind that Lin took a job while claiming to be the Niwaka Samurai.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2CBuDil56yWv7Prv3OCfYjVG2U9.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13276","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"99483","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35889","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"76126","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"337617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"46532","synopsis":"Information is the second most important thing to money. A cyberterrorist cell wants to find a hacker who has uncovered some sensitive details. Meanwhile, Banba 